				<description><![CDATA[]]></description>
			</attacks>
			<backstory><![CDATA[You lived in seclusion—either in a sheltered community such as a monastery, or entirely a lone—for a formative part of your life. In your time apart from the clamor of society, you found quiet, solitude, and perhaps some of the answers you were looking for.]]></backstory>
			<background-trinket>
			</background-trinket>
			<background-traits>The leader of my community had something wise to say on every topic, and I am eager to share that wisdom.I connect everything that happens to me to a grand, cosmic plan.</background-traits>
			<background-ideals>Live and Let Live. Meddling in the affairs of others only causes trouble. (Neutral)</background-ideals>
			<background-bonds>I entered seclusion to hide from the ones who might still be hunting me. I must someday confront them.</background-bonds>
			<background-flaws>I am dogmatic in my thoughts and philosophy.</background-flaws>
			<background>
				<feature name="Discovery">
					<description><![CDATA[The quiet seclusion of your extended hermitage gave you access to a unique and powerful discovery. The exact nature of this revelation depends on the nature of your seclusion. It might be a great truth about the cosmos, the deities, the powerful beings of the outer planes, or the forces of nature. It could be a site that no one else has ever seen. You might have uncovered a fact that has long been forgotten, or unearthed some relic of the past that could rewrite history. It might be information that would be damaging to the people who or consigned you to exile, and hence the reason for your return to society.]]></description>
				</feature>
			</background>
